{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1389140-interactive-novel-night-road","id":1389140,"title":"Interactive novel: Night Road","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-05-16T18:27:39-07:00","id":1389140,"title":"Interactive novel: Night Road","content":"<img src=\"https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steam/apps/1290270/header.jpg?t=1588251790\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1290270/Vampire_The_Masquerade__Night_Road/\" target=\"_blank\">https://store.steampowered.com/app/1...e__Night_Road/</a><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/LjJECztW9Mo\" data-code=\"LjJECztW9Mo\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/LjJECztW9Mo/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> Outstar has done a few interviews regarding this on the White Wolf Twitch/Youtube channel and has shared some interesting bits of information about it:<br /> * It's not a visual novel but a text-based novel.<br /> * It'll be out in the Summer.<br /> * You will actually use Vampire: The Masquerade skills and a character sheet you fill out.<br /> * You will be able to have most Clans but not Malkavians or Nosferatu.<br /> * The premise is that you will be a courier for the Camarilla and delivering messages across the American Southwest.<br /> * You can join the Anarchs, go independent, stay with the Camarilla, or betray everyone as one of the four endings.<br /> * It's only one of three presently being worked on.<br /> <br /> I'm presuming this is replacing the previous text based games that were taken down due to, well, a story too complicated to talk about here (and ugly).<br /> <br /> Edit: Technically, I believe it was only &quot;We Eat Blood&quot; that was taken down and is one of the rare pieces of White Wolf property I've refused to read even on Youtube.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 05-16-2020, 09:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T18:29:12-07:00","id":1389141,"title":"","content":"Sweet! Thanks White Wolf!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T18:43:04-07:00","id":1389148,"title":"","content":"There's apparently two others in the works right now.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.choiceofgames.com/2020/04/coming-soon-three-vampire-the-masquerade-interactive-novels/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.choiceofgames.com/2020/0...active-novels/</a><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Out for Blood<br /> <br /> <i> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/u4ueWl1nlIw\" data-code=\"u4ueWl1nlIw\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/u4ueWl1nlIw/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></i></span></b><br /> <i>Gather your allies to hunt the vampires that terrorize your town! Study their ways and exploit their rivalries, or you\u2019ll become a vampire yourself.</i><i> Take on the role of a vampire hunter to save your town from the influence of Chastain, a vampire more than a century old. When a group of young thin-blood vampires start a war with Chastain, will you choose sides, or hunt them all?</i><br /> <br /> <i>Gather your forces and sharpen your stake to take back the night! Coming in spring 2021. </i><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Parliament of Knives</span></b><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/FisA4jmQkUc\" data-code=\"FisA4jmQkUc\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/FisA4jmQkUc/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <i>Dominate undead politics through cunning and violence! Will a missing Prince give you the opening you need to seize power and take control of the city?</i><br /> <br /> <i>The undead Prince of Canada\u2019s capital city has disappeared, and his second-in-command, Eden Corliss, wants you to find out why. You\u2019ve been loyal to Corliss since she Embraced you and made you a vampire, but this could be your chance to take her place.</i><i> Will you defend your sire from the accusations flying, or join forces with her rivals to bring her down? One careless word could get you stabbed in the back\u2014staked through the heart, and left to burn in the sun.</i><br /> <br /> Who will you save when the knives are out? Coming in fall 2021.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" ta